{"unit_id":"math-lrz__dsh-theme-pack#feature-1","repo":"math-lrz/dsh-theme-pack","commit":"5a4cdbe9e6acc68f467be4af5458d2ea2e2b1616","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-pack 的功能「主题选择器」：在 DSH 设置的通用项目中加入主题色板按钮，展示主题名称和四个预览色点。点击某个色板即可切换到对应主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:31-49","lib/client.js:68-75"]}
